    "ruleType": "stratagem",
    "group": "Annihilation Legion",
    "cp": 1,
    "summary": "In the enemy Movement phase, react immediately when an enemy completes a Fall Back. Pick a friendly unit with either keyword, FLAYED ONES or DESTROYER CULT. At phase start that unit must have been within Engagement Range of the retreating enemy. Roll 1D6. A 2–5 deals D3 mortal wounds to the enemy, and a 6 deals 3. On a 1 there is no damage from this roll. After rolling, your unit may pursue with a Normal move. Its final position must be as near to the retreating enemy as the rules allow.",
